  "updated_at": "2026-03-29",
  "bio": "Maddy Delfgou is an up-and-coming fineline and dotwork tattoo artist based in Sault Ste. Marie, Canada. As an apprentice at @discoverthecanvas, Maddy is honing their skills in realism and micro portrait artistry, with a personal touch of equine affection. For a meticulously crafted tattoo, you can reach out to Maddy for commissions through discoverthecanvas@gmail.com.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Sault Ste Marie, Ontario, Canada",
